{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/d75ea96e3ab9c7509fb560fb1102993c.avif?t=1763972797\" width=800 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you imagine? Not everyone enjoys the zen of pushing a cart through well-stocked aisles with relaxing music in the background... or even has the time for it. That\u2019s where you come in: the town\u2019s go-to professional shopper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/f34449f5e46e618c2503ea813d16967e.poster.avif?t=1763972797\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/f34449f5e46e618c2503ea813d16967e.webm?t=1763972797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/f34449f5e46e618c2503ea813d16967e.mp4?t=1763972797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/2b323c2f5060c0c2edf585f0d966899a.avif?t=1763972797\" width=800 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle client orders in everything from grocery stores to DIY megastores to pharmacies - or all at once. Speed matters. Clients expect their deliveries on time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/bac796fe5879b8f1ae24fad941541316.poster.avif?t=1763972797\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/bac796fe5879b8f1ae24fad941541316.webm?t=1763972797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/bac796fe5879b8f1ae24fad941541316.mp4?t=1763972797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/fad0ddf76f5a8424eb6b50fa783abbdc.avif?t=1763972797\" width=800 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each job, prep your route, check for coupons, tag special deals, and fine-tune your gear. Quality customer service is your name of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/53dbbcdb38b225597436f11a28655512.poster.avif?t=1763972797\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/53dbbcdb38b225597436f11a28655512.webm?t=1763972797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710870/extras/53dbbcdb38b225597436f11a28655512.mp4?t=1763972797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph